WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.911
Identify, explain and apply the important ideas behind presentation file and design

00:00:05.911 --> 00:00:06.387
tools.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:12.683
Slide: is one screen of a presentation. Theme: gives slides a coordinated design.

00:00:13.533 --> 00:00:18.456
Transition: controls how one slide changes to another. Animation: makes an object

00:00:18.456 --> 00:00:22.557
appear or move. Presenter: speaks clearly while showing the slides.

00:00:23.367 --> 00:00:28.226
Make a one-page paper example about your school or a Ghanaian festival. Include

00:00:28.226 --> 00:00:31.964
slide, theme and transition; present it clearly to a partner.
